- fil-a P1 #3 asks for “Artikulo 3” as the only article number. The reviewer is right that the URL is flno=3 of 各類所得扣繳率標準 (the same link 001 already labels as the non-resident dividend withholding-rate regulation), and the visible name is no longer the Business Tax Act. The Korean source link text is 영업세법 제10조, and the checker counts that 10. Changing the label to Artikulo 3 alone failed numbers (missing 10, sourceCount 95 / targetCount 94). The label is therefore “Artikulo 10 ng Regulasyon hinggil sa withholding rate sa dibidendo ng hindi residente (各類所得扣繳率標準)”, URL unchanged.
- fil-a #20 / fil-b #19: deleting U+200B or turning Q16–Q20 into headings is not a wording error the checker will accept. See skipped rows.
- fil-a #29: “1.57 milyong TWD” would drop the pinned token “TWD 1.57M”.
- fil-b #20: joining the chopped sentences would change the block count. Capitalized inside the blocks instead.

